      "claim": "Scientific theories are provisional explanations that are subject to revision when new evidence is obtained.",
      "evidence": "Philosophy of science (Popper's falsifiability, Kuhn's paradigm shifts) states that theories are not immutable and are revised or refined in light of new data.",
